#
# File: 200-ARP-GARP-reply-in-monitor.rule
# Policy: Monitor gratuitous ARP reply candidates for the zone interface address
# Description:
#     Runs after ARP hook and zone interface map/vmap dispatch; no interface matching here.
#     Self-addressed ARP replies are one GARP form; matching does not establish whether unsolicited.
#     Direction: remote-to-local; intended for arp input hook.
#
arp operation reply arp saddr ip $ZONE_INTF_IPADDR arp daddr ip $ZONE_INTF_IPADDR counter comment "remote-to-local GARP reply monitor"
